ha&#x02019; in prostate cancer cells</article-title><source>Evid Based Complement Altern Med</source><access-date>Advance Access published on January 10, 2008</access-date><comment>doi:10.1093/ecam/nem184</comment></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>